"""caretta-deck-panel: Caretta's deck. One window, drawn purple panels on a white ground, the turtle on its cells, a lilac accent.

Keys: y n p s l t as on the design page; r rest, d restart the deck, o shut down and b reboot (both ask first).
Nothing here is invented: with no agent running, the agent panels say so.

  caretta-deck-panel                 the window, under sway
  caretta-deck-panel --png out.png   one frame to a file
  caretta-deck-panel --greeter       the login screen, as the face of greetd: asks the password, then starts the deck
"""
